WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.890
- All right, everybody,
let's wrap things up

00:00:01.890 --> 00:00:04.170
with something really sweet
I found on social media.

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:05.200
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.950
(rock music)
(audience cheering)

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:09.870
Okay, so check out this painting.

00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:11.490
It's by an amazing new artist.

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:13.560
The thing is, he doesn't use brushes.

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:16.170
He doesn't use a roller or pallet knives.

00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:18.450
What he does is totally unconventional.

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:20.820
Let's get him on the line
right now to explain.

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:23.010
Everyone say hi to Mack

00:00:23.010 --> 00:00:24.870
and let's bring in his human companions,

00:00:24.870 --> 00:00:27.390
his partner Corporal Kevin
Henderson and the founder

00:00:27.390 --> 00:00:30.806
of Friends of the Canine
Vests Midwest, Emily.

00:00:30.806 --> 00:00:34.620
Oh my gosh, so y'all gotta
explain like how did this start?

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:36.600
Like did he always love painting

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:38.040
and then it became a fundraising thing?

00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:40.048
Explain how this all started.

00:00:40.048 --> 00:00:42.960
- So, I created Friends of
the Canine Vests Midwest

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:46.470
back in 2020 for my
love of law enforcement

00:00:46.470 --> 00:00:47.400
and dogs in general.

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:49.661
I've been in rescue for over 25 years now.

00:00:49.661 --> 00:00:51.930
And I just found out that these,

00:00:51.930 --> 00:00:54.990
a lot of dogs are working
without vests and they need vests

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:58.350
and they need food and they
need medical attention,

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:01.560
they need retirement packages,
they need get well baskets,

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:02.760
they need all kinds of things

00:01:02.760 --> 00:01:04.920
with these four-legged
heroes that we have.

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:06.630
And I was like, we need to come up

00:01:06.630 --> 00:01:08.790
with a really cool way to fundraise.

00:01:08.790 --> 00:01:11.670
And so, we came up with this concept

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:14.070
where the dogs get to be the Picassos

00:01:14.070 --> 00:01:17.430
and we even had one of our
paintings go for $2,000.

00:01:17.430 --> 00:01:19.110
So, it's a fun and great way

00:01:19.110 --> 00:01:20.760
for us to raise money
to do what we need to do

00:01:20.760 --> 00:01:21.930
for these canines.

00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:22.763
- Oh my God.

00:01:22.763 --> 00:01:25.050
It is hard not to just
keep your eyes on Mack.

00:01:25.050 --> 00:01:25.883
He is adorable.

00:01:25.883 --> 00:01:28.950
So, Mack has made a few paintings, right?

00:01:28.950 --> 00:01:31.620
- Yeah, so I've worked
with Emily for years

00:01:31.620 --> 00:01:33.694
and he's made several
just trying to raise money

00:01:33.694 --> 00:01:36.750
to get these vests for all these dogs.

00:01:36.750 --> 00:01:37.860
We've been able to get vests

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:40.773
for all three of our
agency dogs through Emily.

00:01:41.640 --> 00:01:43.560
Main thing is just trying
to keep the dogs safe

00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:45.630
as possible when they're out working.

00:01:45.630 --> 00:01:47.730
They're put in very dangerous situations

00:01:47.730 --> 00:01:49.620
and they're very good dogs

00:01:49.620 --> 00:01:51.030
and they deserve everything they can get.

00:01:51.030 --> 00:01:51.863
- Absolutely.

00:01:51.863 --> 00:01:54.000
Oh my God, that tongue
hanging outta his mouth.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:56.220
I mean, I just love him so much.

00:01:56.220 --> 00:01:59.970
Thank you so much, Emily,
Corporal Kevin, and Mack.

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:01.200
I'm liking your post right now.

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:04.290
This is such a cool thing to
do and a cool way to fundraise.

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:05.250
That's not all though, everybody.

00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:06.750
Our season long partner Pilot Pen,

00:02:06.750 --> 00:02:09.750
makers of G2 the go-to pen
of "The Kelly Clarkson Show"

00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:11.760
want to support dogs putting themselves

00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:13.320
at risk on the front lines.

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:14.520
So, they're gonna be writing a check

00:02:14.520 --> 00:02:17.760
to Friends of the Canine
Vest Midwest for $1,000.

00:02:17.760 --> 00:02:18.632
How's that sound?

00:02:18.632 --> 00:02:19.996
(audience cheering)

00:02:19.996 --> 00:02:21.536
- [Emily] Awesome.

00:02:21.536 --> 00:02:23.860
- Aw, thank you guys so
much for your service.

00:02:23.860 --> 00:02:26.110
Thank you to all our guests this hour:

00:02:26.110 --> 00:02:30.210
Billy Ray Cyrus, Firerose,
Sam Jay, Christie Kohut,

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:32.460
Arian Langsome, and Marcy Bursack.

00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:33.293
You know what?

00:02:33.293 --> 00:02:34.126
Have a great day, everybody,

00:02:34.126 --> 00:02:35.594
and if it's not, try and change it.

00:02:35.594 --> 00:02:37.380
(rock music)

